Over the last 10 years, intraday trend models have been by far one of our favorite components of a systematic portfolio for a handful of reasons:
...
1. they have no overnight exposure, and therefore no overnight gap risk;
2. they can react quickly to significant supply and demand shocks;
3. they can be applied across many liquid instruments;
4. they have often been negatively correlated during large downside market moves;
5. they can diversify slower trend-following or carry strategies;
